{"id":4598815,"game_id":6,"status":1,"visible":1,"submitted_by":{"id":11831381,"name_id":"spouke1","username":"Spouke1","date_online":1744632978,"avatar":{"filename":"470d1c59ddc84e1d0a529fab9a10481.jpg","original":"https://image.modcdn.io/members/a61d/11831381/470d1c59ddc84e1d0a529fab9a10481.jpg","thumb_50x50":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/members/a61d/11831381/crop_50x50/470d1c59ddc84e1d0a529fab9a10481.jpg","thumb_100x100":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/members/a61d/11831381/crop_100x100/470d1c59ddc84e1d0a529fab9a10481.jpg"},"timezone":"","language":"","profile_url":"https://mod.io/u/spouke1"},"date_added":1735502352,"date_updated":1736288067,"date_live":1735503650,"logo":{"filename":"levillage-modding.jpg","original":"https://image.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/levillage-modding.jpg","thumb_320x180":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/crop_320x180/levillage-modding.jpg","thumb_640x360":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/crop_640x360/levillage-modding.jpg","thumb_1280x720":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/crop_1280x720/levillage-modding.jpg"},"name":"Discord Invite Item","name_id":"discord-invite-item","summary":"New item to easily get invited to the server Discord","description":"<div>\n<div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>This mod implements a new item to the game that can be placed in the action bar. Right-clicking on the item sends the player to the Discord server specified in the ECO server configuration file.</p>\n<p>This ensures players have seamless access to the server's Discord community.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">Key Features:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Automatic Addition</strong>: The item is automatically added to the action bar upon a player's first login to the server.</li>\n<li><strong>Craftable Option</strong>: If the item is lost, it can be crafted using the Small Machine Paper.</li>\n<li><strong>New Chat Commands</strong>:\n<ul>\n<li><code>/DiscordInvite</code>: Opens the Discord invite window.</li>\n<li><code>/DiscordURL</code>: Displays the Discord URL and invite code.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">Installation procedure:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Unzip the file into your server folder \\Server\\Mods\\</li>\n<li>Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Special Thanks to <strong>PadmaN</strong> from SilverLeaf server for the idea and the support.</p>\n<p>For additional Discord functionalities, we recommend <strong>DiscordLink </strong>mod from <strong>Monzun</strong> &amp; <strong>Spoffy</strong>: <a href=\"https://mod.io/g/eco/m/discordlink\">link here</a></p>\n</div>","metadata_blob":null,"profile_url":"https://mod.io/g/eco/m/discord-invite-item","modfile":{"id":5919542,"mod_id":4598815,"date_added":1735503432,"date_scanned":1735503465,"virus_status":1,"virus_positive":0,"virustotal_hash":null,"filesize":91289,"filehash":{"md5":"c89b567fc0371eb1c79aa554ded4241d"},"filename":"discordinvite-10-bz8p.zip","version":"1.0","changelog":"Initial release version\nCompatible ECO v0.11.1.6","metadata_blob":null,"download":{"binary_url":"https://g-6.modapi.io/v1/games/6/mods/4598815/files/5919542/download","date_expires":1807898833}},"media":{"youtube":[],"sketchfab":[],"images":[{"filename":"capture.jpg","original":"https://image.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/capture.jpg","thumb_320x180":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/crop_320x180/capture.jpg"},{"filename":"capture2.jpg","original":"https://image.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/capture2.jpg","thumb_320x180":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/crop_320x180/capture2.jpg"},{"filename":"capture3.jpg","original":"https://image.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/capture3.jpg","thumb_320x180":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/crop_320x180/capture3.jpg"},{"filename":"discordinvite.png","original":"https://image.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/discordinvite.png","thumb_320x180":"https://thumb.modcdn.io/mods/dd6f/4598815/crop_320x180/discordinvite.png"},{"filename